SUMMARY:Boorman and the Devil
DTSTART:20260513T193000Z
DTEND:20260513T213500Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T193000Z
UID:POFYtscQnJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nAfter the success of The Exorcis
 t\, Warner Bros. offered director John Boorman the opportunity of a lifeti
 me\, the chance to direct its sequel\, Exorcist II: The Heretic. And then 
 all Hell broke loose…Director David Kittredge and Co-Producer Craig Smit
 h scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/boorman-and-the-de
 vil\n\nEstimated start: 12:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
