DTEND:20260514T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T224500Z
UID:FgsbP362Fg
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 122 mins (2h02m)\n\nWhen a man comes ashore on a rem
 ote island claiming to be the native son who left long ago\, the mistrustf
 ul inhabitants of the fishing village hold a formal\, three-day trial to d
 etermine his identity.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/trial-of-hein\n\nE
 stimated start: 15:55
