DTEND:20260514T024500Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T010000Z
UID:dCBICZt05Y
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nExpanded from an award-winning Su
 ndance short\, Walter Thompson-Hernández infuses empathy in this lyrical 
 feature about a sensitive boy in Watts who constructs a mythological imagi
 nation for his family\, contrasting sharply with their complicated reality
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/if-i-go-will-they-miss-me\n\nEstimated 
 start: 18:10
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
