DTEND:20260514T025000Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T010000Z
UID:b23c4XqNkZ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nA cast of quirky characters\, in
 cluding an animatronic cowboy and a marathoner with a soft spot for Dick
 ’s burgers\, star in these Washington-made shorts that showcase the vita
 lity of our local filmmaking community. Filmmakers scheduled to attend. S
 tudy your local film trivia before attending the screening because the Sea
 ttle Film Society will be giving away tickets to one of their upcoming ev
 ents! After the screening\, join them and Seattle Documentary Association
  for their Spring Mixer at Queen Anne Beer Hall.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net
 /festival/sound-visions-x41556\n\nEstimated start: 18:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
