DTEND:20260514T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T010000Z
UID:s2iZuRT1yJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 106 mins (1h46m)\n\nSixteen-year-old Dídac spends a
  summer cycling along the Danube with his family. When a mysterious boy ap
 pears\, new emotions stir\, subtly shifting family dynamics and guiding D
 ídac through a transformative journey of first love and self-discovery. T
 his film is generously sponsored by Jeff Stolz & Tim O'Connor.\n\nhttps://
 www.siff.net/festival/strange-river\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown Hous
 e 2 (Sun 17 May\, 11:45 AM)\n\nEstimated start: 18:10
LOCATION:PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific Science Center\, None
END:VEVENT
