 J Kevin Cole helped define not just who Seattle listens to\, but how we li
 sten\, fostering delight and curiosity with every recommendation. RADIOHEA
 RT\, a bio-doc about Cole’s remarkable life\, boasts a killer soundtrack
 \, a wealth of nostalgic archival footage\, and cameos from Seattle musica
 l legends.Directors Peter Hilgendorf and Andrew Franks\, plus Producer Reb
 ecca Staffel and Subject Kevin Cole scheduled to attend.This film is gener
 ously sponsored by David Prokopy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/radiohe
 art-the-drive-and-times-of-dj-kevin-cole\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown
